() Tj T*
(electrical distribution system complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(\(a\) The equipment shall be designed for a maximum ambient temperature of 40°C.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Relative humidity at site may reach 95 %.) Tj T*
(\(c\) The installation is at an altitude of 2600 m above mean sea level.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART D — MAIN LT PANEL) Tj T*
(\(a\) The LT panel shall conform to IS/IEC 61439-1:2020 and IS/IEC 61439-2:2020.) Tj T*
(\(b\) The panel shall be cubicle type, floor mounted, fabricated from CRCA sheet steel of) Tj T*
(2mm thickness.) Tj T*
(\(c\) The rated operational voltage shall be 415 V, 3 phase, 4 wire, 50 Hz.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Main busbars shall be of electrolytic grade aluminium rated for 1600A continuous) Tj T*
(current.) Tj T*
(\(e\) The busbars and panel shall withstand a short circuit current of 50 kA for 1 second.) Tj T*
(\(f\) The degree of protection of the panel enclosure shall be IP54.) Tj T*
(\(g\) The switchboard shall have Form 3b internal separation.) Tj T*
(\(h\) Incomers shall be 1600A, 4 pole, electrically operated air circuit breakers) Tj T*
(conforming to IS/IEC 60947-2:2003.) Tj T*
(\(i\) Outgoing feeders shall be MCCBs with ultimate breaking capacity of 36 kA.) Tj T*
(\(j\) Multifunction meters of accuracy class 0.5 shall be provided on each incomer.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GUARANTEED TECHNICAL PARTICULARS — LT PANEL) Tj T*
(Rated voltage: 415 V) Tj T*
(Rated current of main busbar: 1600A) Tj T*
(Short time current rating: 50 kA for 1 s) Tj T*
(Degree of protection: IP54) Tj T*
(Make and type: \(to be furnished by the bidder\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 4) Tj T*
